              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--light\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">What you get</h2><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚙️</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">The Operator Playbook</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>The complete step-by-step playbook for building agents that actually do work — not just chat.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🧠</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Agent Templates</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Drop-in, battle-tested agent templates you can customize for your own business in minutes.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛠️</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Tooling &amp; Stack</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>The exact tools, workflows, and stack we use — plus honest recommendations on what to skip.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📈</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Real-World Case Studies</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>How real operators are deploying agents in the wild — the wins, the failures, and the lessons.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
