              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--warm\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">From zero to operator in three steps</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step__num\">1</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Learn the Operator Mindset</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>Understand what agents are actually good at, where they fail, and how to think about automation like an owner, not a tourist.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"step reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"step__num\">2</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Build Your First Agent</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>Use the templates and playbook to ship your first working agent — deployed to a real task, with real guardrails.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"step reveal reveal-d2\"><div class=\"step__num\">3</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Operate, Iterate, Own</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>Run the agent like a business asset. Monitor it, improve it, and stack more agents as you grow. You own the systems, not a subscription.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
